"""
jobdiag

Lightweight, read-only SLURM job diagnostics CLI for BMRC.

The script inspects SLURM state using read-only commands (scontrol show,
squeue, sinfo, sprio, and optionally sacctmgr show) to explain:
    - what resources a job requested
    - which candidate nodes are statically eligible
    - which eligible nodes currently have enough unallocated resources
    - whether node states (DRAIN, DOWN, NOT_RESPONDING, MAINT, PLANNED)
      affect scheduling
    - what SLURM reports as the pending reason, expected start, and priority
    - what evidence-based action is supported

jobdiag explains scheduler-visible evidence. It does not reproduce or
predict the complete SLURM scheduler.
"""

